{%- doc -%}
  Nykaa-inspired luxury Brands Mega Menu.
  Showcases top beauty brands, brand logos, live client-side search, alphabetical A-Z index,
  and category tabs (Popular, Luxe, Exclusive, New Launches).
  Every brand link and logo card directs to its vendor/collection page.
  Fully editable via Shopify Theme Editor under Header -> Header Menu blocks.

  @param {object} parent_link - Brands/Home link from main menu
  @param {object} section - Header section
  @param {object} [block_settings] - Header menu block settings
  @param {object} [menu_block] - Header menu theme block (for child brand blocks)
{%- enddoc -%}

